          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Does it matter how many followers I have?",
            "answer": "<p>Not at all. We value authentic and intentional storytellers—no matter the size of your audience.<\/p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_38PVRe": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What kind of creator is Rishi Tea looking for?",
            "answer": "<p>We’re looking for authentic creators with an active Instagram or TikTok presence and a meaningful connection to their community. If you live with intention and show up as a positive force, you’re just the kind of person we want to work with.<\/p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_aQerAm": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Do I need to know a lot about tea to apply?",
            "answer": "<p>Not at all. All we ask is that you’re curious and passionate about exploring the world of tea. We’ll help you learn as you go.<\/p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_yrUGtw": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Can influencers around the world apply?",
            "answer": "<p>At this time, we’re only partnering with creators based in the U.S. Please stay tuned for future opportunities.<\/p>"
          }
